WEBVTT

00:08:30.047 --> 00:08:31.465
The fourth step, to be exact.

00:08:32.299 --> 00:08:36.262
Remove all negative people
out of your life immediately.

00:08:37.304 --> 00:08:42.184
Anybody that's semidoubtful
or naysaying, get them out.

00:08:42.184 --> 00:08:44.353
If you're talking
about your dreams and goals

00:08:44.353 --> 00:08:46.939
and they give small, sarcastic remarks ...

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:48.983
boot them.

00:08:48.983 --> 00:08:50.025
(Laughter)

00:08:50.025 --> 00:08:52.236
Just an all-around negative Nancy?

00:08:52.987 --> 00:08:54.446
Kick them out of there, man.

00:08:55.447 --> 00:08:58.325
Does anybody in the audience
know somebody that's like that?

00:08:58.325 --> 00:08:59.577
Please raise your hand.